{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31920","headline":"积雪 · 贾岛","name":"积雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔属时霖滞，今逢腊雪多。\n南猜飘桂渚，北讶雨交河。\n尽灭平芜色，弥重古木柯。\n空中离白气，岛外下沧波。\n隐者迷樵道，朝人冷玉珂。\n夕繁仍昼密，漏间复钟和。\n想积高嵩顶，新秋皎月过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31920.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31920","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}